If the applicant is found in any illegal activity NEUTRAL CITATION R/CR.MA/19578/2024 ORDER DATED: 12/12/2024 undefined or any similar type of activity, then, concerned Investigating Officer shall have liberty to file an application for cancellation of bail against the present applicant.
